Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. people are pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I I think that there are many problems like this that are just on a precipice,
