Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you you went from you went from $20 or say $10 to 100 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we did that in 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:14:59.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
