Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time you learn something opens a new door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And every time you open a new door, you see more opportunity, you see more challenges, see more problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:16:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that's kind of that's the future.
