Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:13.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:19.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, give me an example of a family, a father, a son, you know, a husband, a wife,
