Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and and so I I agree with you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I I'm I'm fascinated with this idea, you know, the singularity postulates that, you know,
