Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're obviously going to be a technology company.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:16.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Walmart obviously going to be a technology company an AI company.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So super excited for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire telecommunications industry will be reinvented again into an into a technology industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,They were a technology industry a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:27.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,They became a services industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to be a technology industry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm delighted to work with AT&T and Verizon and all, you know, the and in Europe around the world as they reinvent themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and so you you take a look at every one of these industries that touch the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.34,0:23:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I there's a a great idea for reinventing them with AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, we we um I was just in Washington weird, you know, people put us in chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:51.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, and and so we're actually in warehousing logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.48,0:23:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in healthcare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:58.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in automotive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.28,0:24:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in telecommunications.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:03.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every industry in the Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so so we're in light we're we're in we're in life sciences, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and so so all these entertainment obviously for a long for a long time Nvidia was really vastly an entertainment company,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, and so so each one of these verticals uh Nvidia has has a massive stack that's inside of it and and we're very deep in the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.00,0:24:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh and we have excellent partnerships there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you know, one of these days, you know, people might not categorize us as a chip company anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be to take the Alpha IO automotive I guess playbook and insert it into each one of these industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's that's the final that's the final um contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.26,0:24:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in each one of these it takes three computers to build a physical AI platform and so so you need you need a computer to create the brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's the training system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.52,0:24:59.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But very importantly and this is where where you're going to see the labs also do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.80,0:25:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um they need to build a digital twin of the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that they don't have to put their AI agents out into the internet to learn how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so just like we we created Omniverse as the digital twin of warehouses and
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.24,0:25:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,buildings and cities in the physical world we put our robot into the digital twin,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.92,0:25:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,the digital twin learns how to be a robot,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:24.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then we deploy it into the last computer, which is the computer that's inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, for example, a robot or a car or surgical instrument or whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it takes three robots, three computers and three complete stacks and we build complete stacks for each one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.27,0:25:37.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're the only company in the world that does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then if you're a company that that wants to build it end to end, you could use two or three or you know, one of our computers, we don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.33,0:25:47.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so and so each one of our computer has its own software stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.99,0:25:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We do the same across all of our verticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:58.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but of course these capabilities cut both ways, which is why um you know, we hear a lot of people talking about safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.67,0:26:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've been highly critical of the doomer narrative.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.36,0:26:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can only get there if you build the technology responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.88,0:26:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the first thing is build the technology responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.72,0:26:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.68,0:26:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Notice the word build.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an engineering word.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.08,0:26:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about technology, it's about engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.12,0:26:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineers, scientists, researchers, we have to build this technology safely, responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.01,0:26:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and the question is, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the the the answer is absolutely yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because if you can't, then you shouldn't build it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:36.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we either have to believe we can or we shouldn't build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.75,0:26:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.08,0:26:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I believe we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, here, let me just reason about it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.08,0:26:51.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the first part of it is they say some people say that that AI is is uncontrollable because it's impossible to align perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.58,0:26:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alignment means this for all the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, you tell somebody, um, I want you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:26:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:26:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the mission is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mission is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, um, I it's clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because you said it in English, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it could be, uh, I want you to solve this quadratic equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the the mission is to solve the quadratic equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.43,0:27:15.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,The the alignment is how do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.42,0:27:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many ways to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.93,0:27:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,For example, you memorized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.76,0:27:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.32,0:27:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:22.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the answer is, you know, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, or uh, you saw the answer in a textbook, so you looked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.96,0:27:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.41,0:27:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, you refer to a reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:31.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.08,0:27:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you went to a drawer and you you you know that drawer had all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.04,0:27:36.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,You open the drawer, you picked out the answer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:38.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people call that cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, I call that opening the drawer and retrieving the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.28,0:27:41.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.60,0:27:41.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.89,0:27:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's what computers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:46.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of different ways you could solve that problem, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, that one is very explicit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.60,0:27:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.48,0:27:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, be successful in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mission is easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in fact we say it to each other all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:28:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, we say it to our children, we say it to our our friends, let's do our best to to contribute to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.54,0:28:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, now the question is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.88,0:28:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are so many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:14.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you reasonably align and everybody's culture and background and some people think that contributing to society means to be generous,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.77,0:28:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people might mean that contribute to society make a lot of money and and then give philanthropic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.76,0:28:24.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people might so and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.23,0:28:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.00,0:28:25.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.32,0:28:25.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.58,0:28:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And some people might just think that that building a company alone is is or doing something alone is is a sufficient contribution to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:36.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Creating a beautiful piece of art or all of it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the question is what's the alignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.62,0:28:44.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it just depends on your background, your culture, maybe has something to do with where you live, where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.95,0:28:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's just infinite number of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:50.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so my point is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alignment is going to be a forever problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we depend on perfect alignment in order to ensure safety, then we're never going to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.24,0:29:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the answer is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we treat the way we think about babies and when we we're raising kids and you know, we have pets or whatever it is, employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.60,0:29:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start with containment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:17.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,You give them the rights that the access to tools, the access to information,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.82,0:29:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the access to whatever responsibility capabilities that they have, funds, resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:26.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You give them access based on the job that you ask them to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start out with zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.29,0:29:30.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you hire somebody, you start out with zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.35,0:29:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you have a baby that's 1 year old, you put them in a playpen, you assume zero trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you zero trust, you give them minimum rights and you expand that boundary as you learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.89,0:29:46.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so when whenever we have a new AI, we have to assume the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:56.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're testing an AI, zero trust, minimum boundaries, minimum rights, and you expand it as you test and give yourself confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.15,0:30:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, containment, very tight containment is really important to any autonomous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.28,0:30:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second thing you do, uh monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.88,0:30:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the monitoring has to be out of band.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.41,0:30:11.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because if you're if you tell an intelligent person, "Hey, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.26,0:30:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sit here and watch you do your work to make sure you're doing it right."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.76,0:30:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:21.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to sit here and watch you make sure that you're serving customers properly and that you're working hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.71,0:30:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:27.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That that autonomous system is going to behave differently than when you're not watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.28,0:30:29.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like Brad's in the room with me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.56,0:30:32.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:36.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so the the the monitoring has to be out of band and it has to have the
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,ability to observe that the autonomous system is doing something that was inconsistent with the policy or inconsistent with alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.23,0:30:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you have the ability to either escalate or shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.92,0:30:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.24,0:30:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just turn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:52.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so those kind of capabilities have to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.74,0:30:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.13,0:30:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:58.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we we announced it recently called Open Shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:31:00.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have, you know, over 100 100 companies now joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got lots and lots of activity around the world because everybody wants the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Starting at the highest level, you know, when I looked around the table at the White House, Yeah. um everybody around that table, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:12.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.94,0:31:13.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.78,0:31:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think there's this view in the country that there are some leaders of super intelligence that are just yoloing, that don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:22.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're being reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.54,0:31:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,They just want to grab all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.17,0:31:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yet when I looked around their table that table, there wasn't a person in there that I saw that wants to be reckless, that wants to yolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, everybody there wanted to find the right balance between fast and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:39.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was the president's directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I we we debated a little bit what that meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.61,0:31:47.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are different versions of how to implement that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.19,0:31:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, what would you say to the American public who fears that we have a reckless president or reckless leaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:55.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you see any evidence of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:56.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.18,0:32:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you worry about the future that you're bringing into existence with superintelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.84,0:32:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety and security technology Right. are part of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's some weird formulation that AI technology and safety and security are orthogonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.00,0:32:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's kind of like the airbags and the and the braking system Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.68,0:32:26.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the radars, the cameras, um the ABS, uh the the the lane keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that technology is somehow independent of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.20,0:32:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.36,0:32:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters to the car is the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.96,0:32:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:38.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, the whole car is part of the car's technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I say Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.00,0:32:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accelerate AI's technology, what I mean by that is we need to accelerate the security technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.98,0:32:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to accelerate the safety technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.21,0:32:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They all have to be accelerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:50.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.72,0:32:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ask me right now, I think everybody would say, "Let's accelerate security.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:32:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's accelerate safety technology."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.38,0:32:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody says, "No, let's pace that."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:32:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should accelerate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.57,0:33:02.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all part of the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.78,0:33:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't separate capability, functionality from safety and security.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They go as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.24,0:33:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:13.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you deliver the service, nobody's going to say, "You know, good good uh you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.50,0:33:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I really like the the uh the functionality of your service, but boy, is it you know, wrecking havoc."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.28,0:33:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I I think it's all one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.68,0:33:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we treat it as all one thing, and and the industry has to treat it as one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.41,0:33:31.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when we say accelerate, we have to mean accelerating the entire package.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And right now Including the safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.44,0:33:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Including Right. especially the safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mentioned pacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Especially safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.71,0:33:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some people read Pacing the Frontier by Dario um and thought that meant slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.04,0:33:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I thought a funny moment in the room was when the president called on his new best friend Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.70,0:33:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He He referred to him in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.56,0:33:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he said, you know, explain to me, you know, the your version of fast and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.24,0:34:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Dario started off by saying, "Mr. President, you said whoever wins AI wins."
