Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.48,0:34:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he said that we're all speeding up, that they're speeding up, that they want to go fast, that they want to, you know, win the race with China.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.95,0:34:14.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But also acknowledge that along the way we just, to your point you just made,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.11,0:34:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure the safety systems are also speeding up and also keeping pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:21.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I thought that was an important moment where you had, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.66,0:34:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I think people have positioned him as though he's in opposition, right, to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.13,0:34:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it seemed to me that you were all very much on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.97,0:34:37.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,You I You went to the cabinet room with him and and Greg and the other Frontier Labs to sign, uh you know, this agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.42,0:34:41.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was there any chatter, you know, in that room about differences of opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.58,0:34:44.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or was everybody, uh you obviously got it signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did anybody have to be put in a headlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.20,0:34:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or did everybody go willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:52.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, everybody was very very constructive, very productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:35:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um I I I think that that without exception, everybody um is dedicated to advancing the industry safely and securely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.32,0:35:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because if it's not safe, it's not secure, the functionality will never get a chance to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.68,0:35:11.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the capability will never get a get a chance to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.74,0:35:17.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have to We know that the priorities are at all times safety and security.
