Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.52,0:35:22.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It wasn't but 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.32,0:35:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This technology barely worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.72,0:35:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.24,0:35:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the functionality and Without functionality capability, what's the point of making it safe and secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.56,0:35:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody even cares about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.20,0:35:38.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the obviously the first the first job of AI is to to demonstrate it could do something useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.31,0:35:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.63,0:35:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it really reached that point 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.09,0:35:46.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now it really wants to be deployed and and that and broadly deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.50,0:35:53.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so there's no question that the industry the entire industry now has a has a strategic imperative,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.06,0:35:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,an incredible imperative, and great urgency to make sure that whatever we deploy is safe and secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.48,0:36:04.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think I think everybody has completely convinced capable aligned functionality,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.99,0:36:09.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,capability, safety, security, they're all at exactly the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.50,0:36:10.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Priority number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.79,0:36:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so um I the question is winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:16.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I would reframe winning not of the technology industry winning, not of just the AI industry winning.
