Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:31.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing would give me more joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.11,0:36:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The definition of America winning is when we talk about Lilly winning, Walmart winning,
