Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so uh uh our universities winning, our high schools winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.09,0:36:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um you know, that's the definition of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winning with there is no winning if it's just the technology winning, but nobody used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:36:56.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.94,0:36:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.56,0:37:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What what The greatest risk is Of course we're going to you know, I I'll just take it I'll just say baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there will be no technology there will be no AI technology industry if we don't build it safely and securely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.72,0:37:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.06,0:37:13.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The This is an existential issue for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.80,0:37:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and it'll if we make it an existential industry for everybody else,
