Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.76,0:37:21.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.12,0:37:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So so having said that, the definition of winning for us and and I you know, this is the this is the part I always have to change a little bit.
