Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.88,0:37:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want us to pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.32,0:37:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want us to pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And when I see AI winning, America AI winning, I'm looking down from, you know,
