Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.57,0:39:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh I think the demand is definitely there and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.57,0:39:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand is definitely there and more.
