Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.65,1:26:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by the way, those same concerns were expressed at the beginning of the Industrial Revolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.53,1:26:47.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.97,1:26:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.55,1:26:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your level of confidence that in 5 years from now we will have made the right decisions and the world will be that much better place, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.89,1:27:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That we describe because of the investment and all that we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.12,1:27:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you more confident as we sit here today than you were 12 months ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.01,1:27:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm 99.99% just in in in in in service and honor of of a good friend not using zero and 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.89,1:27:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I'm 99.99% 99% confident that that um uh too many of us care do deeply that the outcome turns out well.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.65,1:27:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.17,1:27:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That we will dedicate our might, our intellect, our resources to ensure we get there responsibly and optimistically.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.13,1:27:36.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.53,1:27:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, there's just so many people doing the right things.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.20,1:27:42.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, oftentimes, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.23,1:27:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,there there there's there there people who pontificate about these things and they're informed by several
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.05,1:27:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,several things and they and they they don't realize that there are a lot of people,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.45,1:28:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,industries, incredible researchers and engineers outside of their sphere Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.25,1:28:06.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,of information that are doing amazing things all by themselves independent of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.95,1:28:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just because they didn't say Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.01,1:28:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,they didn't say it doesn't mean a lot of smart people are doing smart things.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.61,1:28:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.13,1:28:17.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and you know, I say this all the time inside the company, even without my leadership,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.55,1:28:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,without strategies, the company is doing smart things all by itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.69,1:28:22.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.25,1:28:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Smart people do smart things.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.08,1:28:27.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They do more impactful things when you organize a line, Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.53,1:28:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but amazing people are doing smart things all by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.89,1:28:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, when somebody tells me that that you know, you're you're worrying about It's good that we worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.97,1:28:36.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.37,1:28:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we should express our worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.49,1:28:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should express our concerns.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.85,1:28:43.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we shouldn't predict the end of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.93,1:28:44.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.32,1:28:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because they're underestimating the human condition, they're underestimating the human capacity,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.39,1:28:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and they think for some some reason with maybe it's just hubris, maybe it's arrogance, that unless they do it, it won't get done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.05,1:28:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.46,1:28:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.87,1:29:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless they do it, it won't get done.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.17,1:29:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is this company is doing amazing things whether I say it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.37,1:29:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, and I you know, I get I get all the accolades and the blame.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.63,1:29:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But um in both cases in both cases I'm fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm especially the accolades.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.25,1:29:20.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so I and the reason for that is just these you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.35,1:29:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,when you surround yourself with amazing people and you create the conditions by which everybody wants the same outcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.01,1:29:28.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,The good the good version of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.50,1:29:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think most people do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.67,1:29:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why I say we need to we need to hold ourselves accountable and responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.97,1:29:38.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we should express a future that's optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.78,1:29:39.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.46,1:29:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I am I am 99.99% certain that surrounded by all the amazing people in the world, we're going to get there together.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.77,1:29:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.61,1:29:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's a I think you're a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.50,1:29:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're lucky to have you helping to lead the charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.73,1:29:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The nation's indebted to you for getting everybody together, getting us all on the same page, building the framework.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.69,1:30:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's going to be more work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.53,1:30:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as a father of two and I know you you have kids, you're going to have grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.86,1:30:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't care about anything more.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.01,1:30:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.65,1:30:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Than actually building a better world for them, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.35,1:30:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could easily stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.61,1:30:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if we stop today, we lose, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.02,1:30:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We lose the opportunity at that better world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.33,1:30:20.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we'll wrap it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.91,1:30:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.01,1:30:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.15,1:30:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Brad, thank you for I've never met a greater patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.15,1:30:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Somebody who who cares so much about the industry but even more so the
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.51,1:30:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,country and and your your gift your gift in your enthusiasm and just tireless energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.69,1:30:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,In in coordinating pulling together a lot of people in order to do something great like what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.45,1:30:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.57,1:31:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a reminder to everybody, just our opinions, not investment advice.
